[Safe] CREATE ROLE app WITH LOGIN NOSUPERUSER NOCREATEDB NOCREATEROLE INHERIT NOREPLICATION NOBYPASSRLS CONNECTION LIMIT -1 VALID UNTIL 'infinity'
[Safe] ALTER ROLE app PASSWORD ********  -- Parola gizlendi; uygulamada girilen değer kullanılır.
[Safe] GRANT "Alpha" TO app WITH ADMIN OPTION
[Safe] GRANT pg_read_all_data TO app
[Safe] GRANT zeta TO app
[Safe] ALTER ROLE app SET search_path = '$user', 'public'
[Safe] ALTER ROLE app SET work_mem = '64MB'
[Safe] COMMENT ON ROLE app IS 'it''s'
WARN: Parola sunucuya düz metin gider; log_statement ve pg_stat_statements açıksa sunucu günlüğüne düşebilir

[Safe] CREATE ROLE r WITH NOLOGIN NOSUPERUSER NOCREATEDB NOCREATEROLE INHERIT NOREPLICATION NOBYPASSRLS CONNECTION LIMIT -1
